// 调试构建的变量表（第 6 轮 6c-4a）：参数、块与遮蔽、for 的初值、for-in、catch 与 switch 臂的绑定、闭包捕获、
// defer 体的多处展开、泛型实例、定宽数值与各种声明类型。scripts/test-native-debug-vars.py 用探针逐语句核对。
struct Point {
    x: int,
    y: int,
}

enum Shape {
    Circle(r: int),
    Rect(w: int, h: int),
    Empty,
}

enum LoadError extends Error {
    Missing(path: string) = `找不到 ${path}`,
}

function area(s: Shape): int {
    return switch (s) {
        case Circle(r) => r * r * 3,
        case Rect(w, h) => load("") catch (e) {
            const cell = w * h;
            return cell;
        },
        case Empty => 0,
    };
}

function load(path: string): int | LoadError {
    if (path == "") { return LoadError.Missing(path); }
    return len(path);
}

function pick < T > (xs: List< T>, i: int): T? {
    const n = listLen(xs);
    if (i < n) { return listGet(xs, i) catch None; }
    return None;
}

function makeAdder(k: int): (int) => int {
    const base = k * 10;
    return (x: int): int => {
        const r = x + base;
        return r;
    };
}

function guarded(n: int): int {
    let total = 0;
    defer {
        const last = total;
        print("defer " + toStr(last));
    }
    if (n > 3) {
        const big = n * 2;
        total = big;
        return total;
    }
    total = n;
    return total;
}

export function main(args: []string): int {
    const p: Point = Point { x: 3, y: 4 };
    let sum = 0;
    for (let i = 0; i < 3; i = i + 1) {
        const sq = i * i;
        sum = sum + sq;
    }
    const xs: List< int> = listNew();
    listPush(xs, sum);
    for (v in xs) {
        sum = sum + v;
    }
    if (sum > 0) {
        const sum = 100;
        print(toStr(sum));
    }
    const b: u8 = 200;
    const f: f32 = 1.5;
    const maybe: int? = pick(xs, 0);
    const names: List< string> = listNew();
    listPush(names, "a");
    const first = pick(names, 0);
    const n = load("cfg") catch (e) {
        const msg = e.message;
        print(msg);
        return 1;
    };
    const add = makeAdder(2);
    print(toStr(p.x + n + add(1) + area(Shape.Rect(2, 3))) + " " + toStr(b) + " " + toStr(guarded(5) + guarded(1)));
    print(toStr(f) + " " + toStr(maybe catch 0) + " " + (first catch ""));
    return 0;
}
